ain[dot]com","formatting_italicEffects_title":"Efek huruf miring","formatting_scientificNames_description":"Nama ilmiah spesies tertentu dari organisme hidup yang menggunakan nomenklatur binomial harus disetel dengan huruf miring.","formatting_scientificNames_title":"Nama ilmiah","formatting_leavingCodeUnchanged_description":"Segala sesuatu yang tampak seperti kode harus tetap tidak diubah.","formatting_leavingCodeUnchanged_title":"Tidak mengubah kode","formatting_keyWordsInBold_title":"Kata kunci yang dicetak tebal","formatting_keyWordsInBold_description":"Selalu setel kata-kata berikut dengan font tebal: apel, pisang, kiwi","item_form_field_zh_formatting-v2_space-between-chinese-and-english_example":"Contoh: 他买了iPhone15，感觉拍照效果很棒。","item_form_field_zh_formatting-v2_space-between-chinese-and-english_name":"Jangan gunakan spasi di antara karakter Mandarin dan bahasa Inggris.","item_form_field_ja_punctuation-v2_corner-brackets-and-periods_name":"Saat menyisipkan kalimat menggunakan tanda kurung sudut (「...」)","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_bracket_name":"Berbagai jenis tanda kurung","preview-own-text_tooltip":"Pratinjau dengan teks Anda sendiri","generate-example_tooltip":"Hasilkan contoh lain","assignedRuleSets":"Aturan khusus yang diberikan kepada Anda:","predefinedRules":"Aturan yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_periods-in-academic-degrees_option_do-not-use_example":"Contoh: PhD; MS","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_periods-in-direct-quotes_option_do-not-use_example":"Contoh: 그는 “오늘은 정말 좋은 날이야”라고 말했다.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_periods-in-direct-quotes_option_use_example":"Contoh: 그는 “오늘은 정말 좋은 날이야.”라고 말했다.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_periods-in-direct-quotes_option_do-not-use_name":"Jangan gunakan","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_periods-in-direct-quotes_option_use_name":"Gunakan","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_periods-in-academic-degrees_option_use_example":"Contoh: Ph.D.; M.S.","item_form_field_en_