setengah penuh (“＆”)","item_form_field_ja_punctuation-v2_emphasis_name":"Gunakan kurung sudut ganda untuk menonjolkan kata-kata.","item_form_field_ja_punctuation-v2_ampersand-usage_option_use-full-width-ampersand_name":"Gunakan tanda ampersand lebar penuh (“＆”)","item_form_field_ja_punctuation-v2_ellipsis_name":"Ketika menghilangkan sebagian kalimat atau meninggalkan kesan yang mendalam.","item_form_field_en_spelling-and-grammar-v2_contractions_option_use-contractions_example":"Contoh: We’ll do our best to get back to you, but we can’t guarantee a response.","spelling-grammar":"Ejaan & tata bahasa","item_form_field_en_spelling-and-grammar-v2_contractions_option_do-not-use-contractions_name":"Jangan gunakan","item_form_field_en_spelling-and-grammar-v2_contractions_option_use-contractions_name":"Gunakan","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_serial-comma_option_do-not-use_example":"Contoh: Apples, oranges and bananas","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_serial-comma_option_use_example":"Contoh: Apples, oranges, and bananas","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_serial-comma_option_do-not-use_name":"Jangan gunakan","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_serial-comma_option_use_name":"Gunakan","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-curly-quotation-marks-and-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: “The king’s hat”","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_apostrophe_option_use-curly-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: J’arrive","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_apostrophe_option_use-curly-apostrophes_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip keriting (’)","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_slash_name":"Di kedua sisi garis miring (/)","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_dash_option_use-tilde_example":"Contoh: 25～30g; 第五～八课","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_dash_option_use-tilde_name":"Gunakan tanda tilde (～) untuk menghubungkan awal dan akhir dari rentang numerik.","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-double-and-single-curly-quotation-marks-and-curly-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: “Sarà per un’altra volta!”","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-double-curly-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: “Bonjour !”","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-double-curly-quotation-marks_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip keriting (“...”)","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_explanatory-note-indicator_option_use-double-em-dash_example":"Contoh: 在今年——农历虎年，必须取得比去年更大的成绩。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_explanatory-note-indicator_option_use-parentheses_example":"Contoh: 哈雷在牛顿思想的启发下，终于认出了他所关注的彗星（该星后人称为哈雷彗星）。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_explanatory-note-indicator_option_use-parentheses_name":"Gunakan tanda kurung untuk catatan penjelas umum yang berfungsi sebagai anotasi daripada bagian dari teks utama dan yang tidak perlu dibaca bersamaan dengan teks di sekitarnya.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_explanatory-note-indicator_option_use-double-em-dash_name":"Gunakan tanda hubung panjang (——) untuk catatan penjelasan penting yang merupakan bagian dari teks utama dan dapat dibaca bersamaan dengan teks di sekitarnya.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_dash_option_use-em-dash_example":"Contoh: 2011年2月3日—10日；北京—上海特别旅客快车","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_em-dash_example":"Contoh: 这家餐厅的招牌菜——虽然价格不菲——绝对值得一试。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_dash_option_use-em-dash_name":"Gunakan tanda hubung panjang (—) untuk menghubungkan awal dan akhir dari item-item yang terkait (seperti waktu, wilayah, dll.).","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_em-dash_name":"Gunakan tanda hubung panjang (——) untuk menandakan konten komentar atau penjelasan tambahan, tanda kurung, jeda, atau interval dalam ucapan, dll.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_comma-and-semicolon_option_use-comma-between-clauses_example":"Contoh: 天色渐暗，路灯亮起，行人加快了脚步。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_comma-and-semicolon_option_use-semicolon-between-clauses_example":"Contoh: 窗外雨声淅沥，偶尔夹杂雷声；屋内，孩子们围坐火炉，听老人讲故事。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_comma-and-semicolon_option_use-semicolon-between-clauses_name":"Gunakan tanda titik koma untuk menandakan jeda ketika sulit membedakan tingkatan dalam kalimat majemuk menggunakan koma (misalnya, jika sudah ada koma di dalam klausa-klausa), dan penggunaan titik dapat mengganggu hubungan antara bagian sebelumnya dan berikutnya.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_comma-and-semicolon_option_use-comma-between-clauses_name":"Gunakan koma di antara klausa-klausa ketika kalimat majemuk tidak rumit dan klausa-klausa yang terhubung relatif singkat, tanpa menggunakan koma untuk jeda di dalam klausa-klausa tersebut.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_option_use-double-angle-brackets_example":"Contoh:《훈민정음》은 1997년...","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: \"훈민정음\"은 1997년...","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks_name":"Menggunakan tanda kutip lurus ganda (\"...\")","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_option_use-double-corner-brackets_example":"Contoh:『훈민정음』은 1997년...","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_option_use-double-corner-brackets_name":"Gunakan kurung sudut ganda (『...』)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_option_use-double-angle-brackets_name":"Gunakan tanda kurung sudut ganda (《...》)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_colon-between-hours-and-minutes-or-chapters-and-verses_example":"Contoh: 오전 11:30, 요한복음 3:5","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_colon-in-heading_example":"Contoh: 일시: 2025년 10월 10일","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_colon-in-heading_name":"Gunakan spasi setelah tanda titik dua dalam judul, tetapi jangan gunakan spasi sebelum tanda titik dua.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_colon-between-hours-and-minutes-or-chapters-and-verses_name":"Jangan gunakan spasi sebelum atau setelah tanda titik dua saat menggunakan pemisah jam dan menit atau bab dan ayat.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_comma-after-conjunctive-adverbs_name":"Komma setelah kata keterangan yang berfungsi sebagai penghubung","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-guillemets-and-curly-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: «Sarà per un’altra volta!»","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-guillemets_example":"Contoh: « Bonjour ! »","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-guillemets_name":"Gunakan tanda guillemets («…»)","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-guillemets-and-curly-apostrophes_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip ganda («…») dan tanda kutip melengkung (’)","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-guillemets_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip guillemets («…»)","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-double-and-single-straight-quotation-marks-and-straight-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: \"Sarà per un'altra volta!\"","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: \"Bonjour !\"","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip lurus (\"...\")","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_apostrophe_option_use-straight-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: J'arrive","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_apostrophe_option_use-straight-apostrophes_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip lurus (')","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_range-indicator_option_use-italian-words-da-a_example":"Contoh: Dal 2001 al 2003; dal lunedì al venerdì","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_range-indicator_option_use-spanish-words-de-a_example":"Contoh: de lunes a sábado; de 2001 a 2003","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_range-indicator_option_use-spanish-words-de-a_name":"Gunakan “da…a” (“dari...sampai”)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_range-indicator_option_use-korean-words-부터-까지_example":"Contoh: 9월 15일부터 9월 25일까지","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_range-indicator_option_use-korean-words-부터-까지_name":"Gunakan “부터…까지” (“dari...sampai”)","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_range-indicator_option_use-italian-words-da-a_name":"Gunakan “da…a” (“dari...sampai”)","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-guillemets-and-straight-apostrophes_example":"Contoh: «Sarà per un’altra volta!»","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-guillemets-and-straight-apostrophes_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip guillemets («…») dan apostrof lurus (&apos;).","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-double-and-single-straight-quotation-marks-and-straight-apostrophes_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip lurus ganda (&quot;...&quot;) dan tanda kutip lurus tunggal (&apos;...&apos;), serta tanda apostrof lurus (&apos;).","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip lurus ganda (\"…\")","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-straight-quotation-marks_name":"(\"...\") Lurus","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_option_use-double-and-single-curly-quotation-marks-and-curly-apostrophes_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip ganda (“...”) dan tanda kutip tunggal (‘...’), serta tanda kutip apostrof (’).","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-double-curly-quotation-marks_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip keriting ganda (“…”)","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip kerinting ganda untuk kutipan utama dan tanda kutip keriting tunggal untuk kutipan sekunder.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip ganda untuk tanda kutip utama dan tanda kutip tunggal untuk tanda kutip sekunder.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_option_use-curly-quotation-marks_name":"(“...”) Keriting","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_name":"Hierarki tanda kutip","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark-and-apostrophe_name":"Tanda kutip dan tanda apostrof","item_form_field_en_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-and-single-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_example":"Contoh: “The first chapter of the UN Charter ‘Purposes and Principles’ is crucial,” said the professor.","fileTypeLimit":"Format berkas yang diperlukan: {{fileTypes}}","prompt-library_use-rule":"Pilih aturan","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_name":"Hierarki tanda kutip","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-curly-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-and-single-curly-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_example":"Contoh: “Kami lebih memilih pendekatan ‘human-in-the-loop’”","punctuation_usingExclamationPoints_description":"Akhiri setiap kalimat dengan tanda seru.","punctuation_usingExclamationPointsSparingly_description":"Gunakan tanda seru secukupnya dan hanya jika sesuai dengan konteksnya.","punctuation_usingExclamationPointsSparingly_title":"Gunakan tanda seru secukupnya","punctuation_usingExclamationPoints_title":"Penggunaan tanda seru","prompt-library":"Pustaka aturan gaya","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-and-double-curly-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_example":"Contoh: «Preferiamo un approccio “human-in-the-loop”»","defaultStyleGuideName":"Panduan Gaya Perusahaan","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-and-double-straight-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_example":"Contoh: «Preferiamo un approccio \"human-in-the-loop\"»","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_colon_option_use-full-width-colon_example":"Contoh: 北京紫禁城有四座城门：午门、神武门、东华门和西华门。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_colon_option_use-half-width-colon_example":"Contoh: 早上8:00","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_colon_option_use-half-width-colon_name":"Saat menampilkan waktu, gunakan tanda titik dua setengah lebar.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_colon_option_use-full-width-colon_name":"Gunakan tanda titik dua penuh (：) setelah frasa umum atau penunjuk (seperti “说,” “例如,” atau “证明”) yang menandakan konten yang akan mengikuti.","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-and-single-guillemets-for-secondary-quotations_example":"Contoh: «Preferiamo un approccio ‹human-in-the-loop›»","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-and-single-guillemets-for-secondary-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip guillemets («…») untuk kutipan dan tanda kutip guillemets tunggal (‹...›) untuk kutipan di dalam kutipan.","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-and-double-straight-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip guillemets («…») untuk kutipan dan tanda kutip lurus ganda (&quot;...&quot;) untuk kutipan di dalam kutipan.","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-and-double-curly-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip guillemets («…») untuk kutipan dan tanda kutip ganda (“...”) untuk kutipan di dalam kutipan.","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-and-single-straight-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_example":"Contoh: \"Preferiamo un approccio 'human-in-the-loop'\"","style-rule_highlight_tooltip":"Aturan gaya yang diterapkan: <strong>{{name}}</strong>","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_bracket_option_use-square-brackets-for-nationality-and-hexagonal-brackets-for-historical-period_example":"Contoh:〔唐〕杜甫著; [英]赫胥黎《进化论与伦理学》","extract_consentToShare":"Saya setuju bahwa DeepL dapat membagikan konten dari berkas saya kepada Amazon Web Services EMEA SARL untuk tujuan mengekstrak aturan gaya yang berpotensi digunakan dalam terjemahan saya. Informasi lebih lanjut mengenai cara kami menangani data pribadi Anda dapat ditemukan dalam <a>Kebijakan Privasi</a> kami.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_bracket_option_use-square-brackets-for-nationality-and-hexagonal-brackets-for-historical-period_name":"Gunakan kurung siku “[...]” atau kurung heksagonal “〔...〕” saat menyebutkan kewarganegaraan penulis atau periode sejarah.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_dash_name":"Penggunaan berbagai jenis tanda hubung","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_colon_name":"Titik dua lebar penuh atau setengah lebar","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_chinese-mixed-with-english_name":"Ketika bahasa Mandarin dicampur dengan bahasa Inggris","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-and-single-straight-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip ganda (&quot;...&quot;) untuk kutipan dan tanda kutip tunggal (&apos;...&apos;) untuk kutipan di dalam kutipan.","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_highlighting-specific-expressions_name":"Untuk menyoroti kata atau ungkapan tertentu dalam teks","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-books-and-newspapers_name":"Ketika menulis judul buku dan surat kabar","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_periods-in-direct-quotes_name":"Titik dalam kutipan","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_ellipsis_option_use-six-dots-at-the-bottom_name":"Gunakan enam titik di bagian bawah (......)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_ellipsis_option_use-three-dots-at-the-bottom_name":"Gunakan tiga titik di bagian bawah (...)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_ellipsis_option_use-six-dots-in-the-center_name":"Gunakan enam titik di tengah (⋯⋯)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_ellipsis_option_use-three-dots-in-the-center_name":"Gunakan tiga titik di tengah (⋯)","item_form_field_it_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-curly-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-and-single-curly-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip ganda (“...”) untuk kutipan dan tanda kutip tunggal (‘...’) untuk kutipan di dalam kutipan.","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-curly-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-then-alternate-with-single-curly-quotation-marks-for-nested-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip ganda untuk kutipan dan bergantian dengan tanda kutip tunggal untuk kutipan bersarang (“ ‘ “ ” ’ ”)","punctuation_colonsToConnectCompleteSentences_description":"Hindari menggunakan tanda titik dua untuk menghubungkan kalimat-kalimat lengkap.","punctuation_colonsToConnectCompleteSentences_title":"Tanda titik dua untuk menghubungkan kalimat-kalimat lengkap","other_anonymizationOfPersonalNames_description":"Semua nama individual harus diganti dengan kata \"ORANG\". Jika dalam sebuah teks terdapat lebih dari satu nama, maka nama tersebut harus diganti dengan PERSONX, di mana \"X\" mewakili sebuah angka. Nomor yang diberikan untuk setiap nama harus tetap sama di seluruh teks.","other_localizingBrandNames_description":"Jika dalam teks sumber terdapat nama merek terkenal, gantilah dengan merek terkenal yang setara dalam bahasa sasaran.","other_replacingBrandNames_description":"Gunakan kata-kata umum sebagai pengganti nama merek. Contoh: \"tisu wajah\" alih-alih \"Kleenex\"","other_replacingBrandNames_title":"Mengganti nama merek","other_localizingBrandNames_title":"Pelokalan nama merek","other_anonymizationOfPersonalNames_title":"Pengaburan nama pribadi","list_emptyState_newHeading":"Tegakkan standar perusahaan untuk penulisan dan terjemahan dengan aturan gaya.","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_salutation_name":"Setelah ucapan salam","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-guillemets-for-primary-quotations-double-curly-quotation-marks-for-secondary-quotations-and-single-curly-quotation-marks-for-further-nested-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip guillemets («…») untuk kutipan, tanda kutip ganda (“…”) untuk kutipan di dalam kutipan, dan tanda kutip tunggal (‘...’) untuk kutipan yang lebih dalam.","ownRulesOnly_noPermission_description":"Bahasa ini hanya mendukung aturan khusus, yang memerlukan izin yang tidak dimiliki oleh akun Anda. Hubungi administrator organisasi Anda untuk meminta akses.","ownRulesOnlyDescription":"Buatlah daftar dan tambahkan aturan gaya Anda sendiri.","ownRulesOnly_noPermission_title":"Anda tidak dapat menambahkan aturan untuk bahasa ini","extractInProgressMessage":"Harap biarkan jendela ini tetap terbuka saat kami menghasilkan aturan untuk Anda.","style-tone_friendlyTone_description":"Tulis seolah-olah Anda sedang berbicara dengan rekan kerja atau teman dekat.","style-tone_friendlyTone_title":"Bentuk yang ramah","punctuation_parenthesesForAsidesAndParentheticalInformation_description":"Jangan pernah menggunakan tanda hubung untuk menandai informasi tambahan. Selalu letakkan informasi dalam tanda kurung.","punctuation_parenthesesForAsidesAndParentheticalInformation_title":"Tanda kurung untuk komentar sampingan dan informasi tambahan","punctuation_colonsInHeadings_description":"Gunakan tanda titik dua di akhir setiap judul.","punctuation_colonsInHeadings_title":"Tanda titik dua dalam judul","formatting_createAndInsertHeading_description":"Buat dan masukkan judul yang relevan ke dalam teks terjemahan.","formatting_createAndInsertHeading_title":"Buat dan sisipkan judul","list_emptyState_pauseAnimation":"Jeda animasi","list_emptyState_playAnimation":"Putar animasi","item_form_field_fr_punctuation-v2_spacing-and-punctuation_name":"Dengan tanda baca tertentu (?, !, :, ;, «, dan »)","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_option_use-double-straight-quotation-marks-for-primary-quotations-then-alternate-with-single-straight-quotation-marks-for-nested-quotations_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip lurus ganda untuk kutipan dan bergantian dengan tanda kutip lurus tunggal untuk kutipan bersarang (\" ' \" \" ' \")","style-rule_highlight_with-option_tooltip":"Aturan gaya yang diterapkan: <strong>{{name}}</strong> dengan opsi <strong>{{option}}</strong>","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_explanatory-note-indicator_name":"Menunjukkan catatan penjelasan","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_comma-and-semicolon_name":"Koma dan titik koma","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_name":"Ketika menandai judul karya kreatif (subjudul, lukisan, lagu), serta merek dagang, undang-undang, dan peraturan.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_option_use-single-angle-brackets_example":"Contoh: 현행〈국어의 로마자 표기법〉은...","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_option_use-single-straight-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: 현행 '국어의 로마자 표기법'은...","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_highlighting-specific-expressions_option_use-single-curly-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: Me ha dado el ‘ok’ para venir mañana; Los eventos más ‘random’ de la semana","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_highlighting-specific-expressions_option_use-single-straight-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: Me ha dado el 'ok' para venir mañana; Los eventos más 'random' de la semana","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_highlighting-specific-expressions_option_use-single-straight-quotation-marks_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip lurus tunggal ('...')","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_quotation-mark_name":"Saat menggunakan tanda kutip","item_form_field_es_punctuation-v2_highlighting-specific-expressions_option_use-single-curly-quotation-marks_name":"Gunakan tanda kutip keriting tunggal (‘...’)","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_chinese-mixed-with-english_option_do-not-place-english-in-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: 这个项目的 deadline 是下周五，我们需要抓紧时间了。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_chinese-mixed-with-english_option_place-english-in-quotation-marks_example":"Contoh: 他总把“think outside the box”挂在嘴边，鼓励我们要有创新思维。","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_chinese-mixed-with-english_option_do-not-place-english-in-quotation-marks_name":"Jangan menempatkan kata atau frasa dalam bahasa Inggris dalam tanda kutip.","item_form_field_zh_punctuation-v2_chinese-mixed-with-english_option_place-english-in-quotation-marks_name":"Tempatkan kata atau frasa dalam bahasa Inggris dalam tanda kutip.","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_option_use-single-straight-quotation-marks_name":"Menggunakan tanda kutip lurus tunggal ('...')","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_option_use-single-corner-brackets_example":"Contoh: 현행 ｢국어의 로마자 표기법｣은...","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_option_use-single-corner-brackets_name":"Gunakan tanda kurung sudut tunggal (「...」)","item_form_field_ko_punctuation-v2_titles-of-creative-works-trade-names-laws-and-regulations_option_use-single-angle-brackets_name":"Gunakan tanda kurung sudut tunggal (〈...〉)","item_form_field_ja_punctuation-v2_quotation-style_name":"Gunakan kurung sudut ganda untuk kurung sudut bersarang.","item_form_field_en_style-and-tone-v2_personal-vs-impersonal-style_option_use-impersonal-style_example":"Contoh: The talent acquisition specialist will contact candidates by Friday.","item_form_field_en_style-and-tone-v2_redundant-phrases_example":"Contoh: Added bonus; basic fundamentals","item_form_field_en_style-and-tone-v2_redundant-phrases_name":"Jangan gunakan frasa yang berulang-ulang jika makna yang sama sudah terdapat dalam satu frasa.","item_form_field_en_style-and-tone-v2_reader-action-required_example":"Contoh: You must log in to view this page.","item_form_field_en_style-and-tone-v2_reader-action-required_name":"Gunakan \"must\"